1. search: search for hidden doors and passages to see if there are any obstacles or shortcuts
2. north: move north until we are adjacent to the stairs down
3. east: move east to the southeast corner of the room
4. south: move south to the southeast corner
5. east: move east until we are adjacent to the stairs down

